<BaseLayout title="About StripUnion" description="Learn what StripUnion covers, how the site is funded and how its editorial and commercial links are separated.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="shell narrow"><span class="kicker">About</span><h1>StripUnion helps adults compare platforms before clicking out.</h1><p class="lead">We cover adult entertainment, dating and retail platforms through reviews, category guides and comparisons. The goal is to make product models and trade-offs easier to understand.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section shell narrow article-body">
    <h2>What we publish</h2><p>StripUnion focuses on platform-level information: access model, paid features, usability, privacy and safety information, category fit and practical limitations. We do not host the third-party services we review.</p>
    <h2>How the site is funded</h2><p>Some outbound links are affiliate links. If a reader completes a qualifying action after using one of those links, StripUnion may receive a commission. Commercial links are labeled separately from editorial navigation.</p>
    <h2>What we do not do</h2><p>We do not fabricate star ratings, testimonials, user counts, awards or claims of hands-on testing that did not occur. Platform information can change, so readers should confirm current pricing and terms with the provider before paying.</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
